WEBVTT

00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:09.610
It's gotten pretty late, huh?

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:10.690
Yeah.

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:12.980
Since Chie-sensei asked us out of the blue...

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:16.910
...to help her with the open day for the prefecture.

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:18.850
Well, it can't be helped.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:21.910
We're the two oldest students in the school.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:23.750
Oh my.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:26.000
Is it just you two today?

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:26.950
Hm?

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:27.730
I guess so.

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:29.440
Where's Rena-chan?

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:31.960
S-She said something about helping out at home,

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:33.870
so she left without us.

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:35.490
Oh, really?

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:40.850
You two look good together.

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:42.140
W-We're not like that!

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:46.020
We were just helping out for the open day!

00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:49.800
What d'ya think she meant by "look good together"?

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:52.400
What d'ya think she meant?

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:55.030
G-Granny?

00:00:55.030 --> 00:01:00.060
If ya make my dear grandkid cry,

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:02.540
ya better prepare ya'self.

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:04.910
W-What are you saying, granny?

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.740
S-Scary.

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:13.500
What's she mean about making you cry?

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:17.350
Well, isn't this a fine afternoon for ya both,

00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:20.040
bein' all lovey-dovey while the sun's still up.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:23.430
Why don'cha stick together sum'more and open the damn road?

00:01:24.030 --> 00:01:26.040
Ya' dimwits!

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:27.850
Talk about dangerous driving.

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:29.980
What's with that guy?

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:37.500
Why do people keep butting in with weird ideas?

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:42.610
W-We're just part of the same club, that's all.

00:01:45.530 --> 00:01:48.750
W-What're you blushing for?

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:52.500
You aren't taking these guys seriously, are you?

00:01:53.410 --> 00:01:55.920
If you keep on pushing, I'll snap, Kei-chan!

00:01:57.010 --> 00:01:58.850
I'd be fine with it.

00:01:58.850 --> 00:01:59.700
Eh?

00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:04.820
Bein' your boyfriend.

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:06.730
What?

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:12.050
R-Retard! Obviously, it's a joke!

00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:14.980
We'd never be like that, right?

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:20.990
What was that for, Mion?

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:23.730
S-Sorry!

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:24.490
Wait!

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:28.130
Ugh, what was that for?

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:35.930
What are those two doing?

00:02:35.930 --> 00:02:38.990
Sis, being who she is, will never get anywhere being that conservative.

00:02:38.990 --> 00:02:42.950
It is only a matter of time before Rena-san takes him home.

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.000
I suppose it's up to me.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:52.400
As her little sister, I might as well lend a hand.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:56.520
Young lady, wouldn't it be better not to interfere too much?

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:59.650
It's fine, I've got a plan.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:04.750
This will only work because we're twins.

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:05.660
I see...

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:31.730
There's something I want to tell you.

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:35.980
It's a secret.

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:39.360
Hey, hey! That's no good.

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:44.030
I don't like scary stories.

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:48.100
I'm going to cast my magic.

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:52.120
...over even the creepy path you always take home.

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:56.250
Over short-cuts, the path to the stage, and our secret base.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:04:00.290
It's simple. Very very easy! (Let's go!)

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:04.430
Swing straight ahead. Happy! Lucky! (1, 2, 3!)

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:08.550
Girls, take a peek into your hearts. (Come on!)

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:12.580
Smiling by accident, my heart races and melts. (1, 2, 3!)

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:16.700
This way? Just kidding. Which way was it, again? (Come on!)

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:21.190
You know, the answer is that I L-O-V-E you!

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:25.280
Happy! Lucky! Dochy! Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:25.280
Happy! Lucky! Which way? Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:29.370
Happy! Lucky! Dochy! No! No! No!

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:29.370
Happy! Lucky! Which way? No! No! No!

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:33.450
Happy! Lucky! Dochy! Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:33.450
Happy! Lucky! Which way? Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:37.760
Happy! Lucky! Dochy! No! No! No!

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:37.760
Happy! Lucky! Which way? No! No! No!

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:54.060
Kei-chan!

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:56.400
M-Mion!

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:59.060
Now what, ya gonna hit me again?

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:00.440
Sorry about yesterday!

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:02.820
I lost control of myself for a moment.

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:07.560
I-It's fine now.

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:10.570
Besides, I was prob'ly pushin' my luck, too.

00:05:10.570 --> 00:05:12.080
Here!

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:14.660
It's an apology for yesterday.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:17.080
An invitation to the dessert festival?

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.580
For me?

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:21.590
It's this Sunday, so I'll be there too.

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:23.510
Why're you gonna be there?

00:05:24.230 --> 00:05:27.010
The manager asked me to help out.

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:29.600
It's fine if you don't want this.

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:32.850
I'll be there! I'm definitely going!

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:34.730
Thanks, Mion!

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:46.420
I wonder if Kei-chan is home.

00:05:48.850 --> 00:05:53.310
Although it's pretty late to be apologising now...

00:05:53.310 --> 00:05:56.680
But... I should apologise...

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:01.380
Urgh... Fine!

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:09.430
Here I come, my paradise!

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:16.020
Onward! To Angel Mort's dessert festival!

00:06:21.390 --> 00:06:23.050
Angel Mort?

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:26.310
For greater glory!

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:30.910
Welcome!

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:33.410
Welcome!

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:38.410
Thank you for coming to Angel Mort's dessert festival!

00:06:39.550 --> 00:06:41.900
Thanks for coming, Kei-chan.

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:46.470
You did invite me and all, it'd be rude to turn you down.

00:06:46.470 --> 00:06:48.860
Let me show you to your table.

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:50.930
R-Right!

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:56.470
But hey, why're you doing this all for me?

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:58.180
Wasn't it just a little slap?

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:01.750
Actually, I wanted to ask you for a little favour, Kei-chan.

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:04.790
Right, I thought it was something like that.

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:06.690
So what's this favour you need?

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:12.150
Recently, I've had some weird customers following me around.

00:07:12.150 --> 00:07:14.780
So I thought, it'd be nice if Kei-chan...

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:19.200
...could pretend to be my boyfriend to get rid of them.

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:20.990
Boyfriend?

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:23.330
Yes, boyfriend.

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:27.710
Hark, what boyfriend?

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:31.240
This bodes ill for us.

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:34.370
Pretty derpy moment if you ask me.

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:39.800
Now, Miss Mion, come and entertain us this moment!

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:42.350
Please, stop!

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:44.460
Hold it!

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:45.360
W-What?

00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:48.230
Get your hands off my girl.

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:52.460
I-Is this the rumoured true love?

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:56.030
Against a 3D guy, w-we're powerless.

00:07:57.300 --> 00:07:58.870
I'm scawed!

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:03.000
T-This isn't what we discussed earlier!

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:07.070
Miss Mion, this favour will cost you!

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:12.850
I could swear I've seen those guys somewhere...

00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:14.360
Thanks a bunch, Kei-chan!

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:16.110
Oh... yeah.

00:08:16.110 --> 00:08:18.010
That was nothing, Mion!

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:22.040
You know, Kei-chan,

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:24.800
when push comes to shove, we can always count on you.

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:29.400
If it's okay with you, Kei-chan...

00:08:30.930 --> 00:08:35.950
Will you be my “hero"?

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:37.910
H-Hero, you say?

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:40.440
For a while now,

00:08:40.440 --> 00:08:43.130
Kei-chan has been...

00:08:43.130 --> 00:08:45.290
M-Mion.

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:48.240
Whoa!

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:52.720
Ow.

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:54.320
Huuh?!

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:57.300
What'cha doin' to our bikes, punk?

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:58.550
Huh?

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:03.870
Wow, she's easy on the eyes.

00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:08.990
We'll let this slide, so why don'cha have a fun time with us?

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:11.690
Hold it.

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:14.320
I knocked over your bikes.

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:16.960
She's got nothing to do with it.

00:09:19.610 --> 00:09:21.540
T-This...

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:27.080
You asked for it, boy!

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:35.840
Hmph, what a loser.

00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:37.900
Kei-chan!

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:43.670
'Stead of this chump, let's you and I share some hot feelings, huh?

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:48.350
What'cha want, pops?

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:54.540
Oh, shit...

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:56.710
This guy's the real deal!

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:07.870
This isn't part of the script...

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:09.830
Kei-chan!

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:15.690
Are you okay?

00:10:15.690 --> 00:10:18.070
Sorry, looks like I've got a big mouth...

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:23.630
Guess I'm not cut out to be a hero, Shion.

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:26.130
I'm sorry, Kei-chan.

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:29.820
I didn't know this would happen, I...

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:31.400
So you are Shion.

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:33.720
W-What are you saying, Kei-chan?

00:10:33.720 --> 00:10:35.580
The gig was up ages ago.

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:39.150
The delinquents, no, the groupies, of Angel Mort,

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:45.500
and with Kasai-san on the scene, there's no mistaking it.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:48.620
If you knew, then why?

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:54.100
I don't know why, but...

00:10:54.100 --> 00:10:56.150
...you were really into it.

00:10:56.920 --> 00:11:02.370
I figured you probably had some reason for all this.

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:03.350
Kei-chan...

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:06.430
So...

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:12.940
...I'll forgive ya.

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:15.650
Kei-chan.

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:30.340
Tasty cookies, crunchy cookies, I'll bake you real well~♪

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:32.960
Hauu!

00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:36.640
I wonder what's going on, I wonder.

00:11:36.640 --> 00:11:39.970
Keiichi-ku and Mi-cha are hugging each other there.

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:41.970
W-What if...

00:11:42.350 --> 00:11:43.380
Hauu!

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:48.080
R-Rena needs to go home and make dinner for dad!

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:58.640
I thought Shion was acting suspiciously, so I followed her...

00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:01.740
But why is she hugging Kei-chan like that?

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:04.740
Gaah!

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:06.280
Hauu!

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:11.500
Gaah!

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:18.280
We've witnessed quite a spectacle.

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:22.590
This has developed into a love entanglement.

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:25.760
What will happen next?

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:31.140
At this rate, Hinamizawa will be showered in blood!

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:36.150
Do you mean a second Great Hinamizawa Disaster?

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:38.940
It'll be terrifying!

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:42.030
I am scared already!

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:45.410
But it's going to be quite the show!

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:46.910
Nipah~

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:49.580
Ohohohohoho~

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:55.540
No, we shouldn't interfere!

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:58.440
Auuu!

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:00.820
Wait!

00:13:19.760 --> 00:13:20.940
So...

00:13:24.180 --> 00:13:27.450
...I'll forgive ya.

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:34.960
Could this be...

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:48.470
Even I want to have a normal life sometimes.

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:54.150
After school, Kei-chan would come pick me up,

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:55.660
then we'd go to a café,

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:59.590
and maybe even study together!

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:01.230
But...

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:04.370
Sis...

00:14:05.310 --> 00:14:09.450
Until now, you've been helping Mion,

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:15.200
but I don't think seeing Keiichi-kun as a man is a bad thing.

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:21.130
What I'm saying is, isn't there more to life than waiting?

00:14:21.510 --> 00:14:23.240
Waiting?

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:32.710
I don't think it's betraying your feelings for Satoshi if you wish for your own happiness.

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:36.140
I wonder if that's true...

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:48.150
I've made up my mind!

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:54.160
I'm getting quite talkative these days.

00:14:58.930 --> 00:15:03.170
I wonder what this feeling is, I wonder.

00:15:03.730 --> 00:15:05.880
Mii-chan is my best friend...

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:08.670
Love is important, but so is friendship,

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:12.790
and I can't have both.

00:15:15.270 --> 00:15:17.450
I wonder why this is happening.

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:21.190
Can't we just get along like we used to?

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:28.470
I want to have lots of fun with Keiichi, just like now...

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:31.410
For example, hiking,

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:33.700
picking flowers,

00:15:35.050 --> 00:15:36.490
and then...

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:38.810
and then...

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:41.440
Hauu!

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:43.760
No, that's not it!

00:15:43.760 --> 00:15:46.710
We've got to be friends with everybody!

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:47.460
Uuu!

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:50.010
Rena, you silly stupid idiot!

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:50.720
Huh?

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:53.510
Nipah~

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:53.510
Ohohohoho~

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:54.340
Wha?!

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:57.230
We've brought the Neighbourly Notice.

00:15:57.230 --> 00:15:59.390
Rika-chan and Satoko-chan?

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:03.580
It is important for everybody to get along.

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:07.360
But some things you've got to say, no matter what.

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:12.860
Rather than just worrying about it, throw in all your chips and go for broke!

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:15.910
That way, you'll understand each other better.

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:17.120
Indeed!

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:20.470
"Understand... each other."

00:16:22.270 --> 00:16:24.620
That's right, that's right.

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:28.740
Nipaa~

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:29.680
Ohohohohoho~

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:32.630
Demons, trolls, you're both despicable!

00:16:37.310 --> 00:16:41.280
I guess Shion really likes Kei-chan,

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:44.260
and I didn't even notice until now.

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:53.800
Do I not make the cut?

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:57.660
Does Kei-chan like more feminine girls?

00:16:58.150 --> 00:16:59.420
What do you think?

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:02.370
Even I...

00:17:03.780 --> 00:17:07.730
Even I'd like to go shopping with Kei-chan...

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:11.630
We'd pick each other's clothes and get matching accessories...

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:16.150
Then we'd go to an amusement park.

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:22.400
But I don't fit in to those sort of things.

00:17:23.260 --> 00:17:26.560
Is it too late for me to be girlish?

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:28.490
What do you think?

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:30.830
What d'ya mean, "What do you think"?

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:32.570
G-Granny?

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:35.330
What'cha waitin' around for?

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:36.300
Huh?

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:38.970
That's a good man ya got your eyes on.

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:41.580
Solid as a rock when it counts,

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:44.250
and a good head on his shoulders too.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:51.590
Well, he's a tad flirty, but in the end, all men are like that.

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:54.140
Y-Yeah...

00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:55.240
Are ya fine with that?

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:57.090
W-With what?

00:17:57.490 --> 00:18:01.850
I'm asking if you're fine with someone else taking him.

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:03.180
Eh?

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:05.670
If you're the next head of the Sonozaki family,

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:10.000
then ya gotta grab onto the things ya want with both hands.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.860
B-But...

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:16.120
Don't worry, Mion.

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:20.990
You're womanly enough just as you are.

00:18:21.770 --> 00:18:22.790
Right.

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:25.640
Thanks, Granny!

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:28.000
I'll try my best! 100 percent!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.780
Give it your all!

00:18:29.780 --> 00:18:30.660
Yeah!

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:35.040
Oh, no, that's not it.

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:40.360
You gotta think about it that way, and if you do this, then you'll get to the answer.

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:42.890
Oh, right, I get it now!

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:46.320
You're quite a good teacher, aren't you?

00:18:46.320 --> 00:18:48.160
Not particularly.

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:52.610
But what's up with asking me to help you study all of a sudden?

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:57.610
I wanted to do something like this at least once.

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:01.410
Did I trouble you?

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:05.080
Well, I'm not really bothered, ya know, just...

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:09.910
I don't want to lose... to my sister.

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:12.420
To Mion?

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:18.460
Ah, no, I mean academically.

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:21.400
Oh, yeah, academically!

00:19:22.870 --> 00:19:25.680
Well, about the next question.

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:38.270
Mm, this is great, it's awesome!

00:19:38.270 --> 00:19:41.200
Here, have some octopus wieners as well.

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:44.330
Also, also,

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:47.160
I brought a bunch of your favourite Special Rena Cookies.

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:51.830
Eat a lot of them, 'kay?

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:56.780
Wow, what's with all the freebies today?

00:19:56.780 --> 00:20:01.840
I wonder, was it bad?

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:04.940
Oh, no, I didn't mean it that way, it's just...

00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:08.610
I was wondering why you're giving these to me.

00:20:09.840 --> 00:20:12.740
Maybe it's because it's you, Keiichi-kun.

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:14.610
Huh, because it's me?

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:20.110
Because I want to do all sorts of fun things with you, Keiichi-kun, so.. so...

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:22.920
So.. so... Rena...

00:20:22.920 --> 00:20:24.860
Hauuu!

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:29.810
I'm gonna make you lots of sweets!

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:42.250
I'm out!

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:45.220
With that, Mii's got the next penalty game!

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:48.580
All right! I'm on a roll, go me!

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:51.920
For Mion-san, that was quite a blatant mistake to make.

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:54.890
It happens.

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:57.110
Oh, really?

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:59.400
Was it really just a mistake?

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:02.150
Huh? What's that mean, Rena?

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:06.810
Rena knows that Mii-chan lost on purpose.

00:21:06.810 --> 00:21:11.160
No, actually, she let Keiichi-kun win.

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:14.360
What do you mean, Rena?

00:21:14.360 --> 00:21:17.750
Mion's our club president.

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:19.670
There's no way she'd...

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:29.160
Huh? what's going on?

00:21:37.180 --> 00:21:39.780
I'm beat.

00:21:39.780 --> 00:21:42.690
Who do you like the most, Keiichi?

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:46.950
Hanyuu.

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:49.390
I heard from Rika-chan and the others...

00:21:49.390 --> 00:21:52.200
...that you've become quite popular, and put in a pickle.

00:21:53.180 --> 00:21:57.000
Well, honestly, I'm happy about being popular and all,

00:21:57.000 --> 00:22:01.210
but I never thought about being a boyfriend or having a girlfriend before.

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:07.230
And if I choose someone, I'm scared that when I make the decision,

00:22:07.230 --> 00:22:11.220
I'll break our current group up, and we'll never get back together again.

00:22:11.730 --> 00:22:14.470
You're so gentle, Keiichi.

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:21.540
But on occasion, kindness can turn into cruelty.

00:22:21.540 --> 00:22:23.980
Rika-chan, Satoko?

00:22:25.070 --> 00:22:26.970
You guys?!

00:22:26.970 --> 00:22:29.430
I agree with what Keiichi-kun says.

00:22:29.430 --> 00:22:30.770
That's right.

00:22:30.770 --> 00:22:35.950
At this rate, our group will fall apart, and we'll never be able to fix it.

00:22:35.950 --> 00:22:40.250
But we also don't want to hurt Kei-chan anymore.

00:22:40.980 --> 00:22:43.880
Then, what do you want me to do?

00:22:43.880 --> 00:22:47.130
We thought up a good plan to settle this.

00:22:47.960 --> 00:22:49.920
A plan?

00:22:56.440 --> 00:22:58.140
What the hell is this?

00:22:58.140 --> 00:23:01.100
We'll spin a blindfolded Kei-chan around,

00:23:01.100 --> 00:23:03.780
and whoever he points to becomes his girlfriend.

00:23:03.780 --> 00:23:05.480
It's a fair and square, no grudges match!

00:23:06.000 --> 00:23:07.360
Is everyone okay with this?

00:23:07.360 --> 00:23:08.530
Yes!

00:23:08.530 --> 00:23:09.560
Eh?

00:23:09.560 --> 00:23:12.780
You guys are really fine with this?

00:23:12.780 --> 00:23:16.000
I think it's a wonderful method.

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:19.660
If you leave it to Lady Luck, there is no reason to fight about it later.

00:23:19.660 --> 00:23:25.290
But aren't Keiichi's feelings completely ignored in this case?

00:23:25.290 --> 00:23:26.880
You be quiet.

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:27.660
Hau!

00:23:27.660 --> 00:23:29.920
Hauuu!

00:23:34.900 --> 00:23:35.930
Okay, start it up!

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:38.200
Here we go!

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:42.440
Spin around and choose your love~♪

00:23:46.440 --> 00:23:50.810
Spin around and choose your love~♪

00:23:54.910 --> 00:23:59.050
Spin around and choose your love~♪

00:24:00.020 --> 00:24:03.190
I choose you!

00:24:04.040 --> 00:24:05.460
How was it?!

00:24:07.220 --> 00:24:10.480
N-No way!

00:24:10.480 --> 00:24:11.970
Oh dear.

00:24:13.470 --> 00:24:16.470
What the heck!

00:24:19.440 --> 00:24:23.350
Looks like I've still got it in me.

00:24:24.250 --> 00:24:26.500
Say “ah”.

00:24:29.230 --> 00:24:32.490
Oh, he's got quite the appetite, this one.

00:24:32.990 --> 00:24:38.560
I didn't want to lose to Mion, but to think I'd lose to another relative like this...

00:24:38.560 --> 00:24:42.700
I'm a bit sad, but I think it's for the best.

00:24:42.700 --> 00:24:45.660
We'll be back to where we were before.

00:24:45.660 --> 00:24:49.750
Damn you, granny!

00:24:50.380 --> 00:24:54.260
Isn't it just like Keiichi to create such a farce?

00:24:54.650 --> 00:24:58.110
It's a lovely happy ending, too bad.

00:24:58.110 --> 00:25:01.270
Thank goodness, thank goodness!

00:25:02.130 --> 00:25:04.270
Here, say “ah”!

00:25:14.630 --> 00:25:18.000
Oh, it's Mion.

00:25:18.000 --> 00:25:24.620
Yeah, I still haven't apologised to you for punching you the other day, so...

00:25:25.390 --> 00:25:26.790
Here, my apology.

00:25:27.770 --> 00:25:29.530
Hmm.

00:25:29.530 --> 00:25:30.510
What?

00:25:30.510 --> 00:25:34.300
In the end, I'm just your guys' plaything, aren't I?

00:25:34.300 --> 00:25:37.110
What are you saying, Kei-chan?!

00:25:38.290 --> 00:25:43.060
At the very least, I... about Kei-chan...

00:25:43.550 --> 00:25:46.060
About me?

00:25:46.650 --> 00:25:49.060
What do you think?

00:25:49.060 --> 00:25:51.060
About what?

00:25:51.060 --> 00:25:56.590
You know... Kei-chan... Hypothetically speaking, do you like tomboyish girls?

00:25:56.590 --> 00:25:59.160
Or do you not like them?

00:26:00.140 --> 00:26:02.920
Tomboyish girls?

00:26:02.920 --> 00:26:05.070
Y-Yeah...

00:26:05.070 --> 00:26:08.790
Hmm... tomboyish girls...

00:26:08.790 --> 00:26:10.590
...ARE THE WORST!

00:26:11.230 --> 00:26:13.340
Eh, really?

00:26:15.210 --> 00:26:17.780
Ha, joke's on you.

00:26:17.780 --> 00:26:20.420
Even if a girl's a tomboy,

00:26:20.420 --> 00:26:24.270
when she suddenly turns beet red she's really cu-

00:26:31.120 --> 00:26:33.000
What was that for?!

00:26:33.000 --> 00:26:34.980
Didn't you come here to apologise?

00:26:36.940 --> 00:26:39.360
The joke's on you!

00:26:41.600 --> 00:26:44.870
Hey, wait up, Mion! Hey, you!

00:26:46.040 --> 00:26:48.260
Catch me if you can!
